#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0032 expect=skipped domain=DS
#note "DSTPTNUM is present and populated, DSTPT is empty -> the row would fire if not scoped out; DS is a member of the included EVENTS class, so ONLY the Domains.Exclude [DX, DS] entry rejects. Discriminator: the FDA twin has no exclusions and would execute here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DS class=EVENTS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col DSSEQ    type=Num
col DSTERM   type=Char
col DSTPTNUM type=Num
col DSTPT    type=Char
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | DISPOSITION EVENT | 1 |
